      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR SOKO (1) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 18.65 beating Tommy's Hitman. The hardest to beat again. SUTTON BOLT (2) is a consistent type who is new to this track. Lines up here in winning form after scoring by 0.8 lengths from box eight at Temora (18.95). The form from his last run stacks up well. Must be included in calculations. MR. SNOW (7) jumped from this box and placed in a Mix 3/4 at this track over 401m latest (23.58). Has a consistent record off this same box, including a win and five minors. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Should be in this for a long way. BLITZ (8) can run a bold race on best form.",
